-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/artillery.html\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/platformer.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/pinball.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/shooter.html\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/adventure.html\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/fighting.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/stealth.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/brawler.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/shooter.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/pointclick.html\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/animlab.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/puzzle.js\nDungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/road.js\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
