{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '2538,2558p' Dungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js && sed -n '2600,2616p' Dungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js\"","aggregated_output":"  _autoPause(reason) { this.input.stopRumble(); return this.o.autoPause !== false && !!this.scene && !!this.scene.pausable && this.pause(reason); }\n  /**\n   * open the menu (the corner's menu button and the touch START do it): a pausable scene (or a game started without\n   * scenes) pauses on its pause screen; any other scene, a title, waits under the settings. menu('settings') or\n   * menu('controls') opens that screen. Without a menu (menu: false, or the agent edition) it pauses a scene in play.\n   * o: { pause: false } opens it over a world that keeps stepping, as game.live does for every pause. Returns true when\n   * a menu opened\n   */\n  menu(name, o) {\n    const sh = this.shell, s = this.scene, play = !!s && (!!s.pausable || this.sceneName === 'main');\n    if (o && o.pause === false && !this.paused) this._goOn = true;   // (until it resumes)\n    if (!sh || !sh._menu()) { if (play) this.pause('player'); return false; }\n    if (!name && play) { this.pause('player'); return true; }\n    if (this.pause('menu')) sh._ownPause = true;\n    sh.show(name || 'settings'); return true;\n  }\n  /** the standard features in a page (section 10b): the page set up for phones, pausing when it is hidden, the player's\n   *  full-screen choice kept, a phone's first tap going full screen, the corner buttons and the menu screens */\n  _standard(signal) {\n    const on = (t, type, fn, o) => t.addEventListener(type, fn, Object.assign({ signal }, o)), fs = this.fullscreen;\n    pageSetup(this.screen.canvas);\n    if (s && s.back && s.back()) return true;\n    if (!s || !(s.pausable || this.sceneName === 'main')) return false;\n    if (this.paused) this.resume(); else this.menu();\n    return true;\n  }\n  /** where the corner's buttons (menu and full screen, top right; the touch START) cover the screen, in screen pixels\n   *  { x0, y0, x1, y1 } (r.W and r.H's space), or null while none show: keep a HUD clear of it */\n  cornerArea() {\n    const c = this._corner && this._corner.style.display !== 'none' ? this._corner : this.input._startEl; if (!c || !c.isConnected || !this.screen.canvas) return null;\n    const q = c.getBoundingClientRect(); if (!q.width) return null;\n    const a = this.input.screenPoint(q.left, q.top), b = this.input.screenPoint(q.right, q.bottom);\n    return { x0: a[0], y0: a[1], x1: b[0], y1: b[1] };\n  }\n  /** show or hide the corner buttons: shown while the game isn't being played (a title, a game over, a pause without\n   *  the menu), for a moment after the mouse comes near the top, and the menu always on a touch screen (with the\n   *  engine's touch buttons it is their START); hidden under an open menu screen (its close button is there) */\n  _cornerSync() {\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The authored route now has 27 chambers across three caves and two summit wings. I’m building the front end, checkpoints, touch controls, and developer tools around the shared simulation, so each play mode uses the same game rules.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > Dungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/src/ui/ui.js <<'EOF'\n(() => {\n  'use strict';\n  const E = My3D2dge;\n  class ExpeditionUI {\n    constructor(app) {\n      this.app=app; this.game=app.game; this.pairOut=''; this.pairIn=''; this.pairStatus=''; this.lastRoute=''; this.lastPhase=''; this.lastNotice=''; this.lastScreen=null;\n      this.shell=new E.Shell(this.game,{\n        theme:{ink:'#f0e6ce',paper:'rgba(11,23,25,.95)',accent:'#e9bc75',muted:'#aebfba',danger:'#eb8d77',line:'#bca26b45',font:'system-ui, sans-serif',titleFont:'Georgia, serif',scale:()=>innerWidth>900?Math.min(2,innerWidth/960):1},\n        screens:{pause:{kicker:'The field journal',title:'Rest a moment',text:()=>app.online?'Your menu is open. The shared expedition continues.':'The lantern waits. Your expedition is paused.',actions:()=>this.pauseActions()},help:{kicker:'The ranger’s handbook',title:'Listen. Place the shot. Find the way.',sections:[['The road','Find an axe, a folded ferry, and the Index Key. Each tool opens the next wilderness route. Reunite the two crown halves at Crownweather.'],['The bow','One press draws and releases one arrow. Misses can be recovered. Three wall reflections at most; a banked shaft can hit its shooter.'],['Light and sound','Every arrow briefly lights a passage and draws listeners toward its landing. Hold focus to move quietly. Tracks and descriptive cues carry the same clues when muted.'],['Survival','Three hearts. Three shared expedition reserves. Restart Section restores its creatures and supplies together, without costing a reserve. In co-op, hold interact beside a fallen ranger.'],['Touch','Drag the left half to move. Double-tap there to quickstep. Tap the right half to shoot; drag it to aim, hold it to listen. Nearby actions appear only when useful. Aim assistance is on; dodge assistance is optional.']],actions:[['Controls & rebinding',()=>this.open('controls')],['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]}},\n        settings:{items:[{key:'aimAssist',label:'Aim assistance',value:true,help:'A modest aim toward visible creatures when no deliberate aim is held.'},{key:'dodgeAssist',label:'Dodge assistance',value:false,help:'Touch: quickstep away from a nearby committed attack.'},{key:'captions',label:'Creature cue captions',value:true,help:'Coarse direction and descriptive sound cues, including while muted.'}],onChange:(settings,key)=>{if(key.startsWith('dev_'))this.applyDevSetting(key.slice(4),settings[key]);}}\n      });\n      if(this.shell.root)this.shell.root.classList.add('dt-shell');\n      for(const sp of DTConfig.sliders)this.game.settings.define({key:'dev_'+sp.key,label:sp.label,type:'slider',group:'Developer',value:DTConfig.defaults[sp.key],min:sp.min,max:sp.max,step:sp.step,apply:()=>{}});\n      for(const [key,label]of[['infiniteHealth','Infinite health'],['infiniteAmmo','Infinite arrows'],['noclip','Pass through walls'],['reveal','Reveal fog'],['collision','Collision overlay'],['navigation','Navigation overlay'],['hearing','Hearing overlay'],['los','Line of sight overlay']])this.game.settings.define({key:'dev_'+key,label,type:'toggle',group:'Developer',value:false});\n      this.shell.root?.addEventListener('pointerover',e=>{if(e.target.tagName==='BUTTON'&&\"'!e.target.disabled)e.target.focus({preventScroll:true});});\n    }\n    open(name,spec={}){this.app.inputs?.clear();if(!this.shell.screen)this.game.menu(name,{pause:!this.app.online});this.shell.show(name,spec);this.syncScreen();}\n    syncScreen(){if(this.shell.root)this.shell.root.dataset.screen=this.shell.screen||'\"'play';}\n    title(){\n      this.shell.hide();this.game.resume();this.lastPhase='';this.lastRoute='';\n      const hasSave=\"'!!this.app.store.read();\n      this.shell.show('\"'title',{kicker:'A lantern-lit expedition · 01',name:'Dungeons and\\\\nDeeper Trouble',subtitle:'The mountain keeps what you have seen.',actions:[\n        {label:'Begin expedition',primary:true,fn:()=>this.newExpedition('solo')},\n        hasSave&&['Continue the trail',()=>this.app.start('solo',true)],\n        ['Two rangers',()=>this.coop()],['Field guide',()=>this.open('help')],['Settings',()=>this.open('settings')],['About & credits',()=>this.about(0)]\n      ],meta:['1–2 RANGERS','BOW · LIGHT · ECHO'],footer:'Inspired by the 1982 Intellivision adventure'});\n      this.syncScreen();\n    }\n    newExpedition(mode){if(this.app.store.read())this.open('new',{kicker:'A fresh trail',title:'Begin another expedition?',text:'Your current local expedition will be replaced when the new one is saved.',actions:[['Keep my trail',()=>this.shell.back()],{label:'Begin anew',primary:true,fn:()=>{this.app.store.clear();this.app.start(mode);}}]});else this.app.start(mode);}\n    coop(){this.open('coop',{kicker:'Share the lantern',title:'Two rangers. One expedition.',text:'Share arrows, tools and the road home. Every passage can also be crossed alone.',actions:[{label:'Couch co-op',primary:true,fn:()=>this.newExpedition('couch')},['Direct online · host',()=>this.pair('host')],['Direct online · join',()=>this.pair('guest')],['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]],sections:[['On the couch','Use two controllers, or keyboard and mouse plus one controller. A free controller joins with Options. Each device belongs to one ranger.'],['Across the internet','Exchange a one-time invitation and reply using your own messaging service. Direct WebRTC; some networks require a relay and cannot connect.']]});}\n    pauseActions(){const app=this.app;return[\n      \"'!app.hub&&['\"'Restart cave / section',()=>this.open('restart',{kicker:'Start this section again',title:'Return to the entry lantern?',text:'Creatures, arrows and supplies return together. No reserve is spent. Progress within this section rolls back.',actions:[['Keep exploring',()=>this.shell.back()],['Restart section',()=>{app.sim.restart();app.save(true);this.shell.hide();app.inputs.clear();}] ]})],\n      ['Field map',()=>this.fieldMap()],['Developer tools',()=>this.dev()],['About & credits',()=>this.about(0)],\n      app.mode==='couch'&&app.sim.state.players.length>1&&['Partner leaves',()=>{app.sim.leave(2);if(this.game.players.length>1)this.game.removePlayer(2);this.shell.toast('One ranger carries on','The shared quiver stays with the expedition.');this.shell.hide();}]\n    ].filter(Boolean);}\n    route(){const app=this.app,s=app.sim.state,n=DTContent.nodes.find(n=>n.id===s.node);const neighbors=DTContent.edges.filter(e=>e.from===s.node||e.to===s.node).map(e=>{const id=e.from===s.node?e.to:e.from;return{node:DTContent.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id),requires:e.requires};});\n      const actions=neighbors.map(({node,requires})=>({label:(requires&&\"'!s.tools[requires]?'\"'◇ '+node.name+' · needs '+requires:'→ '+node.name),disabled:\"'!!requires&&!s.tools[requires],primary:!requires||s.tools[requires],fn:()=>app.travel(node.id)}));\n      this.shell.hide();this.game.resume();this.shell.show('\"'route',{kicker:'The wilderness · choose a trail',title:n?.name||'The old road',text:n?.clue||s.objective,actions:[...actions,['Open journal',()=>{this.game.pause('player');this.shell.hide();this.game.pause('player');this.shell.show('pause');}]],footer:'Axe → forest  ·  Ferry → river  ·  Key → summit'});this.lastRoute=s.node;this.syncScreen();\n    }\n    fieldMap(){const app=this.app,s=app.sim.state,map=app.renderer.getMap?.()||app.renderer.map;if(s.phase\"'!=='\"'cave'||\"'!map){this.open('\"'journal',{kicker:'The expedition journal',title:'A way to the morning',text:s.objective,sections:DTContent.nodes.map(n=>[n.name,n.clue]),actions:[['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});return;}\n      const width=map.w;\n      this.open('map',{title:app.sim.getCave()?.name||'Field map',text:'Only your explored passages are remembered. Arrow light is temporary.',map,at:s.players[0],fog:{visible:([x,y])=>s.visible.includes(y*width+x),seen:([x,y])=>s.explored.includes(y*width+x)},markers:[...(s.pickups||[]).filter(p=>\"'!p.taken&&s.explored.includes(Math.floor(p.y/16)*width+Math.floor(p.x/16))).map(p=>({x:p.x,y:p.y,kind:'\"'diamond',color:'#e9bc75'}))],actions:[['Back to the trail',()=>this.shell.back()]]});\n    }\n    result(){const app=this.app,s=app.sim.state,won=s.phase==='victory',st=s.stats;\n      this.shell.hide();this.game.resume();this.shell.show('results',{kicker:won?'The mountain has kept its promise':'The trail falls quiet',title:won?'Bring the morning home.':'A lantern goes out.',emblem:won?'♛':'◇',text:won?'The Wayfarer’s Crown is whole. Its light belongs to every traveler who finds a way home.': 'Courage carried you this far. There are still roads worth learning.',stats:[[Math.floor(s.time/60)+':'+String(Math.floor(s.time%60)).padStart(2,'0'),'EXPEDITION'],[s.relics.length+'/2','CROWN HALVES'],[st.shots??0,'ARROWS LOOSED'],[st.restarts??0,'RESTARTS']],medals:[['Crown reunited',won],['Unassisted trail',\"'!s.assisted&&!st.assisted],['\"'Three reserves kept',s.reserves===3]],actions:app.hub?[['Expedition journal',()=>this.about(0)]]:[...(\"'!won?[['\"'Continue with assistance',()=>{app.sim.dev('continue');this.shell.hide();app.inputs.clear();this.lastPhase='';}]]:[]),{label:'A new expedition',primary:true,fn:()=>this.newExpedition(app.mode==='couch'?'couch':'solo')},['Return to title',()=>app.toTitle()]]});this.syncScreen();}\n    about(page){const meta=globalThis.DTMeta,source=meta.sourceInformation;const pages=[\n      {title:'The expedition & its makers',sections:[['An original adventure','Dungeons and Deeper Trouble\\\\nListen. Place the shot. Find the way through.'],['Source information',Object.entries(source).map(([k,v])=>k.replace(/([A-Z])/g,' \"'$1'\"')+': '+v).join('\\\\n')],['Credits & licenses','Original game, writing, procedural art, animation and score built by OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol, ultra.\\\\nmy-3D2dge engine by Michael Crosato; license preserved in this HTML.\\\\nAI Hub session client 1.4.0 by Michael Crosato; unchanged.\\\\nSource reference: Advanced Dungeons & Dragons (Mattel/APh, 1982), Tom Loughry. This is an original homage.']]},\n      {title:'Testing feedback',sections:meta.testingFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['Issues found','Critical issues','Most helpful test','Least helpful test'][i],v])},\n      {title:'Engine feedback',sections:meta.engineFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['Best part','Where I got stuck','Built for this game','Hardest integration','Engine changes','One improvement'][i],v])},\n      {title:'Prompt feedback',sections:meta.promptFeedback.map((v,i)=>[['Best part','What was confusing','Hardest part','Suggested change'][i],v])}\n      ];const current=pages[page];this.open('about',{kicker:'Field notes · '+(page+1)+' / 4',title:current.title,sections:current.sections,actions:[...(page<3?[[['Testing feedback','Engine feedback','Prompt feedback'][page],()=>this.about(page+1)]]:[]),...(page>0?[['Previous page',()=>this.about(page-1)]]:[]),['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});}\n    dev(){const app=this.app;this.open('developer',{kicker:'Developer tools · '+(app.hub?'read-only session diagnostics':'experiments are assisted'),title:'Look beneath the mountain.',text:app.hub?'AI Hub owns this round. World-changing tools are disabled; diagnostics remain available.':'Changes affect this visit and mark the expedition assisted. Your ordinary save is kept separately.',actions:[\n      ['Inspect simulation & network',()=>this.inspect()],...(\"'!app.hub&&(!app.net||app.net.authority)?[\n      ['\"'Restore health & reserves',()=>{this.mutate('health');this.shell.toast('Rangers restored','This expedition is marked assisted.');}],['Cheats & overlays',()=>this.devToggles()],['Warp to a lantern',()=>this.devWarp()],['Spawn a creature',()=>this.devSpawn()],['Choose a seed',()=>this.devSeed()],\n      ...[...new Set(DTConfig.sliders.map(s=>s.group))].map(group=>['Tune '+group.toLowerCase(),()=>this.devSliders(group)]),['Single fixed step',()=>{app.sim.step(1/120);app.renderer.update(0,app.sim.state,{});this.inspect();}],['Restart this encounter',()=>{app.sim.restart();this.shell.hide();}],['Reset every tunable',()=>{app.sim.resetTunables();this.game.timeScale=1;for(const s of DTConfig.sliders)this.game.settings.set('dev_'+s.key,DTConfig.defaults[s.key]);this.shell.toast('Defaults restored');}]]:[]),['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});}\n    mutate(action,value){if(this.app.hub||this.app.net&&\"'!this.app.net.authority)return;this.app.sim.dev(action,value);this.app.sim.state.assisted=true;}\n    devToggles(){this.open('\"'dev-cheats',{kicker:'Assisted expedition',title:'Cheats & diagnostic overlays',rows:['dev_infiniteHealth','dev_infiniteAmmo','dev_noclip','dev_reveal','dev_collision','dev_navigation','dev_hearing','dev_los'],actions:[['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});}\n    applyDevSetting(key,value){if(\"'!this.app.sim||this.app.hub)return;if(DTConfig.defaults[key]!==undefined){this.app.sim.setTunable(key,value);if(key==='\"'timeScale')this.game.timeScale=value;}else if(['collision','navigation','hearing','los'].includes(key))this.app.overlays[key]=value;else this.mutate(key,value);this.app.sim.state.assisted=true;}\n    devSliders(group){this.open('dev-tune',{kicker:'Live balance · '+group,title:group+' tuning',text:'Existing actors use the new values immediately.',rows:DTConfig.sliders.filter(s=>s.group===group).map(s=>'dev_'+s.key),actions:[['Reset this page',()=>{for(const s of DTConfig.sliders.filter(s=>s.group===group))this.game.settings.set('dev_'+s.key,DTConfig.defaults[s.key]);this.devSliders(group);}],['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});}\n    devWarp(){this.open('dev-warp',{kicker:'Assisted expedition',title:'Choose a lantern',actions:Object.values(DTContent.caves).map(c=>[c.name,()=>{this.mutate('warp',c.id);this.shell.hide();this.lastPhase='';}]).concat([['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]])});}\n    devSpawn(){this.open('dev-spawn',{kicker:'Assisted expedition',title:'Choose a visitor',actions:Object.keys(DTContent.creatures).filter(k=>k\"'!=='\"'target').map(kind=>[kind,()=>{this.mutate('spawn',kind);this.shell.toast('A '+kind+' appears','At the nearest safe floor.');}]).concat([['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]])});}\n    devSeed(){this.open('dev-seed',{title:'Choose the expedition seed',text:'Starts an isolated assisted expedition. Campaign geometry stays authored; small variations use this seed.',actions:[7,42,1729,65537].map(seed=>[String(seed),()=>{this.app.start('dev',false,seed);this.app.sim.state.assisted=true;}]).concat([['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]])});}\n    inspect(){const app=this.app,s=app.sim.state;this.open('diagnostics',{kicker:'Authority diagnostics',title:'The living expedition',sections:[['State','Tick '+s.tick+' · seed '+s.seed+' · phase '+s.phase+'\\\\nCheckpoint '+(app.sim.checkpoint?.state?.cave||app.sim.checkpoint?.cave||'map')+' · reserves '+s.reserves+' · quiver '+s.quiver],['Actors',(s.players.map(p=>'Ranger '+p.id+': '+p.hp+' hearts at '+Math.round(p.x)+','+Math.round(p.y)).concat(s.enemies.filter(e=>e.hp>0).map(e=>e.id+': '+e.state+' / '+e.hp))).join('\\\\n')],['Arrows & recent noises','Projectile IDs: '+s.arrows.map(a=>a.id).join(', ')+'\\\\n'+s.noise.slice(-6).map(n=>n.kind+' at '+Math.round(n.x)+','+Math.round(n.y)).join('\\\\n')],['Transport',JSON.stringify(app.net?.inspect()||{role:'in-process authority',players:s.players.map(p=>p.id)},null,2)]],actions:[['Refresh',()=>this.inspect()],['Back',()=>this.shell.back()]]});}\n    async pair(role){if(this.app.hub)return;this.app.pairing=true;this.pairStatus='';this.pairOut='';this.pairIn='';this.app.peer?.cancel();this.app.peer=DTNet.createPeer(this.app.networkHooks());this.pairRole=role;this.renderPair();if(role==='host'){try{this.pairOut=await this.app.peer.offer();this.renderPair();}catch(e){this.pairStatus=e.message;this.renderPair();}}}\n    renderPair(){if(\"'!this.app.pairing)return;const host=this.pairRole==='\"'host';this.open('pair',{kicker:'Direct co-op · '+(host?'host':'guest'),title:host?'Invite another ranger.':'Answer the invitation.',text:this.pairStatus||this.app.peer?.status,sections:[['One-time pairing',host?'1. Copy your invitation to your partner.\\\\n2. Paste their reply.\\\\n3. Connect.':'1. Paste the host’s invitation.\\\\n2. Make a reply and copy it to the host.\\\\n3. Wait for the host to connect.']],actions:[\n      {label:host?'Copy invitation':'Copy reply',disabled:\"'!this.pairOut,primary:true,fn:()=>this.copyPair()},[host?'\"'Paste reply':'Paste invitation',()=>this.pastePair()],\n      {label:host?'Connect':'Make reply',disabled:\"'!this.pairIn,fn:()=>this.connectPair()},['\"'Text exchange',()=>this.pairFallback()],['Cancel',()=>{this.app.peer?.cancel();this.app.peer=null;this.app.pairing=false;this.app.toTitle();}]\n    ],footer:'Invitations expire after 10 minutes. Same game file required. No account or room server.'});}\n    async copyPair(){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.pairOut);this.pairStatus='Copied. Send the entire text to your partner.';}catch{this.pairStatus='Clipboard is unavailable here. Use Text exchange to copy manually.';this.pairFallback();return;}this.renderPair();}\n    async pastePair(){try{this.pairIn=await navigator.clipboard.readText();this.pairStatus='Pairing text received.';}catch{this.pairStatus='Clipboard access was refused. Paste into Text exchange.';this.pairFallback();return;}this.renderPair();}\n    pairFallback(){this.open('pair-text',{kicker:'Direct co-op · text exchange',title:'Exchange the whole message.',text:'Copy your outgoing message, or paste the incoming message below. Keyboard shortcuts work inside these fields.',actions:[['Use incoming text',()=>{this.pairIn=this.shell.root.querySelector('#pair-input')?.value||this.pairIn;this.shell.back();this.renderPair();}],['Back',()=>{this.shell.back();this.renderPair();}]]});const box=this.shell.root?.querySelector('.esh-mod');if(\"'!box)return;for(const [id,label,value,readOnly]of[['\"'pair-output','Your outgoing message',this.pairOut,true],['pair-input','Their incoming message',this.pairIn,false]]){const wrap=document.createElement('label');wrap.className='dt-pair-text';wrap.textContent=label;const field=document.createElement('textarea');field.id=id;field.value=value;field.readOnly=readOnly;field.spellcheck=false;field.rows=3;field.setAttribute('aria-label',label);field.onkeydown=e=>e.stopPropagation();wrap.append(field);box.insertBefore(wrap,box.querySelector('.esh-btns'));}}\n    async connectPair(){try{if(this.pairRole==='host')await this.app.peer.accept(this.pairIn);else this.pairOut=await this.app.peer.answer(this.pairIn);this.pairStatus=this.app.peer.status;}catch(e){this.pairStatus=e.message;}this.renderPair();}\n    update(){const app=this.app,s=app.sim.state,screen=this.shell.screen;this.syncScreen();if(screen\"'!==this.lastScreen){app.inputs?.clear();this.lastScreen=screen;}\n      if(app.frontend||app.attract)return;\n      if(s.phase==='\"'victory'||s.phase==='defeat'){if(this.lastPhase\"'!==s.phase)this.result();this.lastPhase=s.phase;return;}\n      if(s.phase==='\"'map'&&\"'!s.transition&&(this.lastRoute!==s.node||(!screen&&!this.game.paused)))this.route();\n      if(s.phase==='\"'cave'&&this.lastPhase\"'!=='\"'cave'){this.shell.hide();this.game.resume();this.shell.toast(app.sim.getCave()?.name||'Below the mountain',app.sim.getCave()?.entrance||'');}\n      this.lastPhase=s.phase;\n      const p=s.players.find(p=>p.id===app.localId)||s.players[0],context=p?app.sim.context(p.id):null;\n      const notice=typeof s.notice==='string'?s.notice:s.notice?.text;\n      if(notice&&notice\"'!==this.lastNotice){this.shell.toast('\"'Trail notes',notice,6);this.lastNotice=notice;}\n      const touch=this.game.input.lastDevice==='touch';\n      const captions=this.game.settings.captions?(s.cues||[]).slice(-1)[0]:null;\n      this.shell.hud({objective:{step:s.phase==='cave'?(app.sim.getCave()?.subtitle||'Below the mountain'):'The wilderness',title:s.objective||'Find the road to Crownweather',text:[s.tools.axe?'AXE':'',s.tools.boat?'FERRY':'',s.tools.key?'KEY':'',s.relics.length?('CROWN '+s.relics.length+'/2'):''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')},status:{text:app.online?'TWO RANGERS · SHARED QUIVER':app.mode==='couch'?'COUCH EXPEDITION':'THE WAYFARER',color:'#e9bc75'},bars:s.players.map(p=>({label:'Ranger '+p.id+(p.down?' · FALLEN':''),value:p.hp,max:3,kind:'pips',color:p.id===1?'#eeaa79':'#a8d4d0'})),counts:[['ARROWS',s.quiver+'/'+(app.sim.tunables?.quiverCapacity||12)],['RESERVES',s.reserves]],place:app.sim.getCave()?.name||'The old road',prompt:context?.label?{act:'interact',label:context.label,hint:context.hint||'',progress:p?.reviveProgress||0}:null,tip:captions?{title:captions.direction||'An echo',text:captions.text||String(captions)}:null,keys:touch?[]:[[this.game.input.label('fire'),'Fire'],[this.game.input.label('focus'),'Listen'],[this.game.input.label('dash'),'Quickstep'],[this.game.input.label('map'),'Map']],buttons:touch&&context?.label?[[context.label,()=>this.game.input.tap('interact')]]:[]});\n    }\n  }\n  globalThis.DTUI=ExpeditionUI;\n})();\nEOF\ncat > Dungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/src/ui/style.css <<'EOF'\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#071317;overflow:hidden;width:100%;height:100%;color:#f0e6ce}body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}canvas#screen{display:block;width:100vw;height:100vh;image-rendering:pixelated;touch-action:none}*{box-sizing:border-box}button:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #f5d496;outline-offset:4px}\n.dt-shell{--pt:22px\"'!important;--pl:24px!important;--pr:24px!important;--pb:18px!important}.dt-shell .esh-pan{border-radius:2px;border-color:#d0b27550;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#102327f5,#0a171af5);box-shadow:0 8px 28px #0008}.dt-shell .esh-sh{background:#030c12c9;padding-top:30px}.dt-shell .esh-sh.esh-ttl{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#061116f2 0%,#07151bd8 33%,#07151b55 61%,transparent 82%);padding-top:15px;overflow-y:auto}.dt-shell .esh-ttl>div{width:420px;max-width:52%;padding-left:22px}.dt-shell h1{font-size:49px;line-height:.99;letter-spacing:-.045em;font-weight:400;white-space:pre-line;color:#f2e5c9;text-shadow:0 3px 22px #0009;margin-top:14px}.dt-shell .esh-ttl .esh-k{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.21em;color:#debd85;border-top:1px solid #debd8580;padding-top:14px;width:max-content;max-width:100%}.dt-shell .esh-sub{font:italic 13px/1.5 Georgia,serif;color:#b8c5b7;margin-top:15px}.dt-shell .esh-ttl .esh-btns{margin-top:23px;max-width:260px;gap:3px}.dt-shell .esh-ttl button{min-height:32px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;padding:8px 12px;border:none;border-left:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;border-radius:0;color:#bfc9c0}.dt-shell .esh-ttl button:focus,.dt-shell .esh-ttl button:hover{background:#e9bc7512;color:#f9e8c5;border-left-color:#e9bc75;outline:none}.dt-shell .esh-ttl button.pri{background:#dcb475;color:#142124;position:relative;padding-left:14px;margin-bottom:5px}.dt-shell .esh-ttl button.pri:after{content:'\"'→';position:absolute;right:14px}.dt-shell .esh-tags{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.16em;margin-top:18px;color:#7e9b9b;gap:14px}.dt-shell .esh-ttl .esh-m{font-size:8px;margin-top:8px;color:#799093}.dt-shell .esh-mod{max-height:94%;padding:22px 24px;width:min(520px,100%)}.dt-shell h2{font-size:29px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:5px 0 12px}.dt-shell .esh-k{font-size:10px}.dt-shell .esh-m{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55}.dt-shell .esh-sh button{border-radius:1px;min-height:36px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px}.dt-shell button:hover{border-color:#e9bc7590}.dt-shell button:focus{outline:1px solid #e9bc75;outline-offset:2px}.dt-shell .esh-row{padding:9px 0}.dt-shell .esh-row>span{font-size:13px}.dt-shell .esh-row small{font-size:11px}.dt-shell .esh-sec{padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #e9bc7526;margin-top:18px}.dt-shell .esh-obj{max-width:265px;border:0;border-left:2px solid #d4ad70;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#061317eb,#06131