{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'ls Dungeons-and-Deeper-Trouble-Advanced-Dungeons-and-Dragons-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-035453/reports && tail -18 PROGRESS.md'","aggregated_output":"audio-signals.json\nbuild.json\ncave.png\nember.png\nhub-bringup.json\nhub-fixture.html\nhub-harness.json\nmap.png\nnetwork-browser.json\nnetwork-fixture.html\nrime.png\nsim-play.json\nsim-play.log\nsimulation-tests.json\ntitle.png\n\n## Integration checkpoint\n- Full plan read. Original manual/history/screenshot inspected; video unavailable. docs/research.md records links/facts.\n- Vendored engine full handoff 0.89.1 / 8ecc2f6 and Hub client1.4.0 /35a1047 unchanged.\n- Parallel tasks: simulation owns src/config.js, src/content/campaign.js, src/sim/* and simulation tests; render_audio owns world.js/score.js; network owns network.js + real protocol/RTC/Hub tests.\n- Root implemented save/save.js, input/input.js, ui/ui.js + style.css, main.js, build.mjs. First single HTML built (1431 KiB), not yet accepted.\n- Network bring-up evidence:15 protocol checks,10 real WebRTC checks,6 Hub fixture scenarios/79 checks. Actual artifact matrix now delegated. Moderate pairing cancel bug fixed; aim retention inspection bug fixed.\n- Render agent now inspecting actual artifact with one browser; network agent may use second, root avoids browsers until they finish.\n- Authored27 rooms,10 wilderness landmarks,3 tool delves+two guardian wings. Simulation agent developing legitimate action director and validation.\n- Provisional exit-interview.json exists and bundles credits; MUST replace pending claims/counts with actual final evidence before delivery.\n- app inspector global __DT has app,game,state,command,start,snapshot,save,dev namespaces. Build: `node <dev>/scripts/build.mjs`. Test orchestrator still to implement.\n\n## Known next checks\n- Verify menu integration, correct pause/live behavior, saves, controller/touch/attract and final file with actual browser.\n- UI context was designed for sim.context({label,type,target,enabled}); fog arrays numeric; sim.load(save payload), snapshot current only; resumeRevision changes checkpoint/death.\n- Native audio constructor DTAudio(game) takes update(state,dt,focus,{title}). Renderer update must pass title:false explicitly after title (options merge).\n- Root routing no world click hit handler yet; add via renderer.nodeScreen with shell route background click. Check keyboard direction map navigation works via shell.\n- Only actual tests can establish issue counts. Root verification ledger initially in docs/verification.md.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"Testing has caught integration issues in title sizing, the title-to-cave camera transition, and audio resuming after menu changes. Those fixes are in place. The current pass is exercising saves, pause, rebinding, controller loss, touch cancellation, and attract-mode isolation.\n"}}
