{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_110","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('../exit-interview.json');data=json.loads(p.read_text());data['testingFeedback'][0]=data['testingFeedback'][0].replace('11 distinct','12 distinct');data['testingFeedback'][2]='The full production-command solo/co-op expeditions and guest-departure-to-solo-clear test exposed progression, bank navigation and delayed transport failures that short smoke tests missed.';p.write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('docs/verification.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Count:11.', 'Count:12.').replace('Simulation51-check', 'Simulation52-check').replace('sprint140.858s,48shots,30hits,12banks','sprint141.267s,48shots,30hits,13banks')\ns=s.replace('| SIM-003 | Moderate | Navigation steering stalled against a diagonal low bank; complete replay caught it. Added radius-aware passage steering. |', '| SIM-003 | Moderate | Navigation steering stalled against a diagonal low bank; complete replay caught it. Added radius-aware passage steering. |\\\\n| SIM-005 | Moderate | A fractional actor position beside a bank had a blocked cell center, and navigation accepted an edge crossing the bank. The full real-peer campaign caught it. Pathfinding now checks physical clearance along every edge, validates fractional anchors and rechecks cached connectors. |')\ns=s.replace('No performance/FPS target was imposed or claimed.', 'No performance or FPS target was imposed or claimed.')\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('docs/network.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Implementation created; browser integration and actual artifact/harness checks pending root integration. No WAN or physical-device claim.','Implementation and actual artifact integration are verified below. Final aggregate results are in reports/test-results.json. WAN and physical-device verification remain unknown.');p.write_text(s)\nPath('reports/test-results-initial.json').write_text(Path('reports/test-results.json').read_text())\nPY\ncat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Final replay regression\n- First quiet full run:299 checks passed,1suite failed outof15. All inputs/audio/packaging/protocol/lifecycle/departure/Hub checks passed; the complete co-op director stalled beside Root’s diagonal bank.\n- Independently reproduced actual navigation defectSIM-005: a clear fractional actor position had a blocked cell center; path accepted a connecting edge through a thin bank. Fixed physical clearance on every path edge, fractional start/goal anchors and cached connector revalidation. Simulation now52/52, unassisted solo141.2667s,48shots,30hits,13banks,0damage,52checks. Network owner rerunning affected real co-op before root final fullrun.\n- Final test-discovered defect count now12,4critical. exit-interview.json and in-game feedback updated. Additional inspection findings remain separately labeled.\n- Initial fullrun report preserved as reports/test-results-initial.json and exact failure as reports/campaign-bank-regression.log. Generic scripts/test.mjs processes from other workstation runs are not ours; none were touched.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
