{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_124","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib\nr=Path('reports');full=json.loads((r/'test-results-full.json').read_text());patch=json.loads((r/'test-results.json').read_text());(r/'test-results-packaging.json').write_text(json.dumps(patch,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nentries={s['suite']:{**s,'verifiedArtifactSha256':full['sha256']} for s in full['suites']}\nfor s in patch['suites']:entries[s['suite']]={**s,'verifiedArtifactSha256':patch['sha256']}\ncombined={\\\"artifact\\\":patch['artifact'],\\\"sha256\\\":patch['sha256'],\\\"passed\\\":sum(s['count'] for s in entries.values()),\\\"failed\\\":sum(not s['passed'] for s in entries.values()),\\\"suites\\\":list(entries.values()),\\\"runs\\\":[\\\"reports/test-results-full.json\\\",\\\"reports/test-results-packaging.json\\\"],\\\"note\\\":\\\"Full 15-suite run passed 309 checks. A visible storage-denial notice and one regression were then added; all affected product/browser/extended checks and the actual final-file Hub matrix passed in a 156-check run. The union is 310 distinct checks. Other production behavior is unchanged.\\\"}\n(r/'test-results.json').write_text(json.dumps(combined,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nconfig=json.loads(Path('build-config.json').read_text());artifact=Path('..')/config['filename'];assert hashlib.sha256(artifact.read_bytes()).hexdigest()==combined['sha256'];meta=json.loads(Path('../exit-interview.json').read_text());assert meta['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import';assert len(meta['testingFeedback'])==4 and len(meta['engineFeedback'])==6 and len(meta['promptFeedback'])==4\np=Path('docs/verification.md');s=p.read_text().replace('Final full-run status is recorded there and in root PROGRESS.md after completion.','Final result: 310 distinct checks pass with zero failures across 15 suites. The full run passed 309; a final storage-denial notice added one assertion, and all affected browser/product checks plus the actual final-file Hub matrix were rerun (156 checks). Both run reports and their artifact hashes are retained.');s=s.replace('storage denial tested;', 'storage denial and its visible, non-blocking memory-only notice tested;');p.write_text(s)\nprogress=f'''# Progress — complete\n\n## Deliverables\n- Game: \"'`{config['\"'filename']}\"'` in this workspace root. Open directly in a browser; no sibling dependencies.\n- Development sources: `{Path.cwd().name}/`.\n- Interview: `exit-interview.json` in root; exact TASK.md shape, parsed and validated.\n- Final HTML SHA-256: `{combined['\"'sha256']}\"'`.\n- Title: **Dungeons and Deeper Trouble**, selected by crypto.randomInt from50 privately generated candidates.\n\n## Final verification\n- **310 distinct checks passed, zero failures,15 suites.** The complete run passed309. A final visible storage-denial notice added1assertion; affected product/browser/extended coverage plus actual final-file Hub matrix then passed156checks. Union/lineage: dev `reports/test-results.json`; raw runs `test-results-full.json` and `test-results-packaging.json`.\n- Simulation52; native render/audio11; product12; browser/input33; extended UI/touch18; audio signals/lifecycle29; presentation3; content validator1.\n- Network151 checks: protocol15, realRTC10, fullco-op9, guestleave→legitimate solovictory9, latejoin/reconnect9, default pairingUI6, Hub93 across6 scenarios.\n- Full unassisted solo clear:141.2667 simulated seconds of perfect knowledge,48shots,30hits,13banks,0damage/deaths/restarts. Both guardians,alltools/relics,ordinary production commands. This is a speedrun, not first-play pacing evidence.\n- Real two-peer campaign and guest-departure-to-solo finish passed. Actual Hub harness includes adverse latency/loss,hostleave,dedicated authority with no localhero,oneplayer,and explicit guestremoval.\n- Source/feedback complete in-game and exit-interview. No pending implementation work. All test-owned browsers,contexts,RTCconnections and localservers close in cleanup.\n\n## Substrate and architecture\n- Engine: unmodified full my-3D2dge0.89.1, commit8ecc2f62353761187bdfe226f327b7ea5d2eb691. MIT notice in HTML.\n- Hub: unmodified client1.4.0/protocolv1,commit35a1047f2067b2af3de3943f0fe452f39105d869; first script aftercharset.\n- Deterministic simulation owns27chambers,10landmarks,arrows,acoustics,fog,enemy/guardian states,progression,checkpoints and party inventory. Native renderer/audio read state; root input/UI/save and common authority transports adapt it.\n- `npm run build` rebuilds root HTML. `npm test` is the quiet acceptance command; `-- --only=product,browser` selects affected suites. Installed PlaywrightPython is used, no browser downloads.\n- Authoring schema/example/validator: docs/authoring.md. Research,architecture,network,simulation and rendering records are in docs/.\n\n## Defects and practical limits\n-12 distinct test-discovered game defects fixed;4critical. Exact ledger in docs/verification.md. Initial failed co-op replay is retained as reports/campaign-bank-regression.log; it exposed fractional-position navigation crossing a diagonal bank, now fixed with radius-aware complete edge/anchor checks.\n- Additional inspection findings, including live supply yield, developer clocks, input assists and accurate diagnostic overlays, were fixed and recorded separately.\n- Original manual/history/screenshot inspected. Embedded video could not be retrieved; original exact sound timbres unknown. All shipped music/cues/voices are new code synthesis; music10%default.\n- Physical controller/touch/TV,real iOS,human listening,WAN/NAT and18–25minute first-play timing remain unknown. Browser/device/audio stand-ins were tested as described. PublicSTUN has a boundedLAN fallback; no TURN service is bundled.\n'\"'''\nPath('../PROGRESS.md').write_text(progress)\nprint(f'Final receipt: {combined[\\\"passed\\\"]} distinct checks, {combined[\\\"failed\\\"]} failures; HTML {artifact.stat().st_size} bytes; interview JSON valid.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
